<title>POLAND: LUBAWA TURNS TO PLN 34,200 PROFIT IN NOV.</title>
<headline>LUBAWA TURNS TO PLN 34,200 PROFIT IN NOV.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.03 vs   0.47 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.09 vs   0.65 loss</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.04 vs   0.53</p>
<p> Sales		    1.38 vs   1.66</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.75 vs   0.78</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.94 vs   1.38</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.89 vs   1.85</p>
<p> Sales		   23.87 vs  18.10</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish technical garment maker is</p>
<p>Zaklady Konfekcji Technicznej Lubawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
